st critters react to being hopped on differently.  For instance, hopping on a blue birdy will propel Floomy upwards, while another might suck you up, then spit you out.<br></li><li>Don't forget to spend your gems at the Hop Shop to enhance Floomy's abilities!</li></ul><br><strong>You got this, now hop to it!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391200/extras/fa5b607fdd331ddbea0ad4e6dd74249d.poster.avif?t=1705703277\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2391200/extras/fa5b607fdd331ddbea0ad4e6dd74249d.webm?t=1705703277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
